    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको साथै पश्चिमी वायुको पनि आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा भने सरदर स्थानको दक्षिणतर्फ रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, the country is under the influence of monsoon winds, with a partial influence of westerly winds as well. The monsoon trough is currently located south of its normal position.",
    "today_np": "",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in Lumbini Province and the Himalayan and hilly areas of the country, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the remaining Terai areas. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan areas of Gandaki Province and at a few places in the remaining Himalayan areas. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the hilly areas of Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and at a few places in the hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at a few places in the Terai areas of Lumbini Province and at one or two places in the remaining Terai areas. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly areas of Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly areas of the country, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai areas. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of the country. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at one or two places in the Terai areas of the country. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
